{"id":116330394559254,"type":"artist","name":"Damien Jurado","artist":null,"year":1972,"weight":10,"info":{"country":"US","begin":"1972-11-12","kind":"Person","similar":["A.A. Bondy","Kevin Morby","Great Lake Swimmers","Phosphorescent","Jason Molina","David Bazan","M. Ward","Micah P. Hinson","Iron & Wine","Cass McCombs"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Damien_Jurado.jpg?width=500","bio":"Cantautor torturado e hipersensible y emblema de Sub Pop hasta que decidió dar el salto a Secretly Canadian a principios de década, Damien Jurado se ha convertido casi sin hacer ruido en el portavoz de los relatos trágicos y las canciones que acaban mal. De ese constante transitar por lado más áspero y oscuro del folk han nacido grandes obras como “The Ghost Of David” o “And Now That I’m In Your Shadow”, discos de los que el de Seatte parece distanciarse ahora para firmar “Caught In The Trees”","tags":["folk","singer-songwriter","indie","americana","indie rock"]},"works":[{"id":199347951699300,"type":"album","name":"Waters Ave S","artist":"Damien Jurado","year":1997,"weight":6,"yt":"Ebj2MECr8Tk","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":237307232531141,"type":"album","name":"Rehearsals for Departure","artist":"Damien Jurado","year":1999,"weight":8,"yt":"JEw1FX2GWQk","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":173793889343323,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1999","rank":158,"scaruffi":null},{"id":216253704998822,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Indie Folk","rank":153,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":280595685348402,"type":"album","name":"Ghost Of David","artist":"Damien Jurado","year":2000,"weight":11,"yt":"jKTXVQ3q7mg","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":76687108203,"name":"Scaruffi 2000s","rank":308,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":216253704998822,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Indie Folk","rank":